[{:db/id 17592186096830 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-4611fa95-3984-5432-82fc-4aa1ab6a6967" "question-601c3d78-5b89-5552-acb7-b5618e1d28f8" "question-395c9bcf-c73e-5ebd-b5f5-5752cb5f3e44"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186096831 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-abe2124c-7cb3-538b-9274-4eab950d2782" "question-cfd5d01f-68da-5044-a541-b2046cbc9096" "question-7bc6f22d-8d3d-514a-8037-cf0e1ab0434e"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186096832 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-2ab531ef-b57e-5769-8250-354ac0b4cc1b"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186096833 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-4a652b8e-bfd2-5735-84e4-910c649c4ba7" "question-67ca50b0-637c-5544-b80a-0086acfa0a59" "question-5e890818-44b2-5fa4-a0b6-4c9a2cfbfd6f"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-4611fa95-3984-5432-82fc-4aa1ab6a6967" :question/id #uuid "4611fa95-3984-5432-82fc-4aa1ab6a6967" :question/math-academy-id "q-352630" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{2}^{7}\\frac{1}{4\\sqrt{2{sin}^{2}⁡x+x+2{cos}^{2}⁡x}}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We use the Pythagorean identity:\n\n$$\n{sin}^{2}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x=1\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we compute the given integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{2}^{7}\\frac{1}{4\\sqrt{2{sin}^{2}⁡x+x+2{cos}^{2}⁡x}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{4}{\\int }_{2}^{7}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x+2({sin}^{2}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x)}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}{\\int }_{2}^{7}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x+2\\cdot 1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}{\\int }_{2}^{7}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x+2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{x+2}\\,{|}_{2}^{7} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\sqrt{7+2}-\\sqrt{2+2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\sqrt{9}-\\sqrt{4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(3-2) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e099fb0b-5d08-54ae-a545-4841ad9b09ce"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e099fb0b-5d08-54ae-a545-4841ad9b09ce" :answer-field/id #uuid "e099fb0b-5d08-54ae-a545-4841ad9b09ce" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-18079da6-58a4-549e-98f0-7b53cc7a9c72" :answer-field/choices ["answer-18079da6-58a4-549e-98f0-7b53cc7a9c72"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-18079da6-58a4-549e-98f0-7b53cc7a9c72" :answer/id #uuid "18079da6-58a4-549e-98f0-7b53cc7a9c72" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-601c3d78-5b89-5552-acb7-b5618e1d28f8" :question/id #uuid "601c3d78-5b89-5552-acb7-b5618e1d28f8" :question/math-academy-id "q-352629" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{2{sin}^{3}⁡x}{1-{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We use the Pythagorean identity:\n\n$$\n{sin}^{2}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x=1\\,⟹\\,1-{cos}^{2}⁡x={sin}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we compute the given integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{2{sin}^{3}⁡x}{1-{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x & =2{\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{{sin}^{3}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\,{|}_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /4} \\\\  & =-2[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})] \\\\  & =-2\\cdot (\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}) \\\\  & =\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-d26c1e60-1d16-502f-81c1-ec7f13cd31c7"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-d26c1e60-1d16-502f-81c1-ec7f13cd31c7" :answer-field/id #uuid "d26c1e60-1d16-502f-81c1-ec7f13cd31c7" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-e17c38ec-6906-5229-841a-2efe64cdf94b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e17c38ec-6906-5229-841a-2efe64cdf94b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e17c38ec-6906-5229-841a-2efe64cdf94b" :answer/id #uuid "e17c38ec-6906-5229-841a-2efe64cdf94b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-395c9bcf-c73e-5ebd-b5f5-5752cb5f3e44" :question/id #uuid "395c9bcf-c73e-5ebd-b5f5-5752cb5f3e44" :question/math-academy-id "q-352622" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{{e}^{4}-1}\\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x+x}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We use the Pythagorean identity:\n\n$$\n{sin}^{2}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x=1\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we compute the given integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{{e}^{4}-1}\\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x+x}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{{e}^{4}-1}\\frac{1}{1+x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1+x)\\,{|}_{0}^{{e}^{4}-1} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡[1+({e}^{4}-1)]-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1+0) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡({e}^{4})-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1) \\\\  & =4-0 \\\\  & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-47b0b5ff-9531-59e7-8cea-348236536a5c"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-47b0b5ff-9531-59e7-8cea-348236536a5c" :answer-field/id #uuid "47b0b5ff-9531-59e7-8cea-348236536a5c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-4f938ab7-2fee-5212-a3d5-1a636aa8f01c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-4f938ab7-2fee-5212-a3d5-1a636aa8f01c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4f938ab7-2fee-5212-a3d5-1a636aa8f01c" :answer/id #uuid "4f938ab7-2fee-5212-a3d5-1a636aa8f01c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-abe2124c-7cb3-538b-9274-4eab950d2782" :question/id #uuid "abe2124c-7cb3-538b-9274-4eab950d2782" :question/math-academy-id "q-362798" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{{sec}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x({tan}^{3}⁡x+\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we select the identity that contains a ${tan}^{2}⁡x$ term. So, we can use the identity \n\n$$\n1+{tan}^{2}⁡x={sec}^{2}⁡x.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we compute the given integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{{sec}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x({tan}^{3}⁡x+\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{{sec}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\operatorname{tan}⁡x({tan}^{2}⁡x+1)}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{{sec}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\cdot {sec}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\operatorname{tan}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /4}\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\,{|}_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /4} \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})-(-\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})) \\\\  & =-\\sqrt{2}-(-2) \\\\  & =2-\\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a395c87e-abf9-5742-944f-23bde4fbd8e1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a395c87e-abf9-5742-944f-23bde4fbd8e1" :answer-field/id #uuid "a395c87e-abf9-5742-944f-23bde4fbd8e1" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-276aab9b-ffdf-5b59-bf38-04c9aff0899f" :answer-field/choices ["answer-276aab9b-ffdf-5b59-bf38-04c9aff0899f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-276aab9b-ffdf-5b59-bf38-04c9aff0899f" :answer/id #uuid "276aab9b-ffdf-5b59-bf38-04c9aff0899f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2-\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-cfd5d01f-68da-5044-a541-b2046cbc9096" :question/id #uuid "cfd5d01f-68da-5044-a541-b2046cbc9096" :question/math-academy-id "q-73527" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int (8{x}^{3}-2{tan}^{2}⁡x-2)\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we select the identity that contains a ${tan}^{2}⁡x$ term. So we can use the identity \n\n$$\n{tan}^{2}⁡x+1={sec}^{2}⁡x.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we compute the given integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (8{x}^{3}-2{tan}^{2}⁡x-2)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (8{x}^{3}-2({tan}^{2}⁡x+1))\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (8{x}^{3}-2{sec}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2{x}^{4}-2\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a76e6cf8-d6fc-5fed-b981-732822fa34e4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a76e6cf8-d6fc-5fed-b981-732822fa34e4" :answer-field/id #uuid "a76e6cf8-d6fc-5fed-b981-732822fa34e4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-916d355a-d995-57ca-985a-adb9f65e34b7" :answer-field/choices ["answer-03bdaab2-0459-58ae-a8b6-8b7e961433b0" "answer-82bb6b98-f551-51d7-8c45-510ea2939429" "answer-916d355a-d995-57ca-985a-adb9f65e34b7" "answer-4473c0b8-d717-5666-b3a5-b13736dbd9a3" "answer-543e21b0-8a43-5f83-99a5-6a65c94df81a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-03bdaab2-0459-58ae-a8b6-8b7e961433b0" :answer/id #uuid "03bdaab2-0459-58ae-a8b6-8b7e961433b0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{4}-2\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-82bb6b98-f551-51d7-8c45-510ea2939429" :answer/id #uuid "82bb6b98-f551-51d7-8c45-510ea2939429" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{4}-2\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-916d355a-d995-57ca-985a-adb9f65e34b7" :answer/id #uuid "916d355a-d995-57ca-985a-adb9f65e34b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{4}-2\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4473c0b8-d717-5666-b3a5-b13736dbd9a3" :answer/id #uuid "4473c0b8-d717-5666-b3a5-b13736dbd9a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{8}{3}{x}^{3}-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-543e21b0-8a43-5f83-99a5-6a65c94df81a" :answer/id #uuid "543e21b0-8a43-5f83-99a5-6a65c94df81a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{8}{3}{x}^{3}-\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-7bc6f22d-8d3d-514a-8037-cf0e1ab0434e" :question/id #uuid "7bc6f22d-8d3d-514a-8037-cf0e1ab0434e" :question/math-academy-id "q-352651" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}x(1+{tan}^{2}⁡x){cos}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "In this case, we have to use the identity  $1+{tan}^{2}⁡x={sec}^{2}⁡x.$ Substituting this into our integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}x(1+{tan}^{2}⁡x){cos}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}x{sec}^{2}⁡x{cos}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}x\\cdot \\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot {cos}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi /4} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{16}-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{32}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-de843182-7831-5a84-81e5-3228bf7e7dcc"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-de843182-7831-5a84-81e5-3228bf7e7dcc" :answer-field/id #uuid "de843182-7831-5a84-81e5-3228bf7e7dcc" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-87f28fc4-335f-515f-b4a3-dc2afe725bdd" :answer-field/choices ["answer-87f28fc4-335f-515f-b4a3-dc2afe725bdd"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-87f28fc4-335f-515f-b4a3-dc2afe725bdd" :answer/id #uuid "87f28fc4-335f-515f-b4a3-dc2afe725bdd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{32}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-2ab531ef-b57e-5769-8250-354ac0b4cc1b" :question/id #uuid "2ab531ef-b57e-5769-8250-354ac0b4cc1b" :question/math-academy-id "q-73517" :question/problem "$\\int ({x}^{2}+5{cot}^{2}⁡x+5)\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "In this case, we have to use the identity  $1+{cot}^{2}⁡x={csc}^{2}⁡x.$ Substituting this into our integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ({x}^{2}+5{cot}^{2}⁡x+5)\\text{d}x & =\\int ({x}^{2}+5({cot}^{2}⁡x+1))\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int ({x}^{2}+5{csc}^{2}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}-5\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-3e7afbe3-da6c-5c70-9675-1af28ae108a4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-3e7afbe3-da6c-5c70-9675-1af28ae108a4" :answer-field/id #uuid "3e7afbe3-da6c-5c70-9675-1af28ae108a4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-0ad53142-ca5c-5050-8255-c2bf7f34c973" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f7191b76-8b73-524d-9752-f1a9544d8d3c" "answer-0697a92c-8206-5e12-8a38-d0cce8f0b796" "answer-0ad53142-ca5c-5050-8255-c2bf7f34c973" "answer-7a0f1722-492f-5d0d-b85d-b801f734974d" "answer-2396ae55-dd62-5c4f-8d14-716f3b077ffd"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f7191b76-8b73-524d-9752-f1a9544d8d3c" :answer/id #uuid "f7191b76-8b73-524d-9752-f1a9544d8d3c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}+5\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0697a92c-8206-5e12-8a38-d0cce8f0b796" :answer/id #uuid "0697a92c-8206-5e12-8a38-d0cce8f0b796" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}+5{cot}^{2}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0ad53142-ca5c-5050-8255-c2bf7f34c973" :answer/id #uuid "0ad53142-ca5c-5050-8255-c2bf7f34c973" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}-5\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7a0f1722-492f-5d0d-b85d-b801f734974d" :answer/id #uuid "7a0f1722-492f-5d0d-b85d-b801f734974d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}-5\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2396ae55-dd62-5c4f-8d14-716f3b077ffd" :answer/id #uuid "2396ae55-dd62-5c4f-8d14-716f3b077ffd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}-5{cot}^{2}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186323576 :answer-field/correct "answer-80e254bb-01fa-560a-b35d-95dbd95c9a3e" :answer-field/choices ["answer-80e254bb-01fa-560a-b35d-95dbd95c9a3e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-80e254bb-01fa-560a-b35d-95dbd95c9a3e" :answer/id #uuid "80e254bb-01fa-560a-b35d-95dbd95c9a3e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-4a652b8e-bfd2-5735-84e4-910c649c4ba7" :question/id #uuid "4a652b8e-bfd2-5735-84e4-910c649c4ba7" :question/math-academy-id "q-49323" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\frac{{cos}^{3}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})}{{sin}^{2}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})-1}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "From the identity  ${cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta =1$ with $\\theta =x+\\frac{\\pi }{6},$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})+{sin}^{2}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{6}) & =1 \\\\ {sin}^{2}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})-1 & =-{cos}^{2}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{6}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{cos}^{3}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})}{{sin}^{2}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})-1}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{{cos}^{3}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})}{-{cos}^{2}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-fde1e6aa-3904-5bc7-8bc1-4efe5c7c9097"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-fde1e6aa-3904-5bc7-8bc1-4efe5c7c9097" :answer-field/id #uuid "fde1e6aa-3904-5bc7-8bc1-4efe5c7c9097" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-b96b832a-78b1-56de-b64f-6e8bbc3e0065" :answer-field/choices ["answer-70b508c8-5bef-5ba4-be2d-d5c002a6fd14" "answer-b96b832a-78b1-56de-b64f-6e8bbc3e0065" "answer-6779cc08-804c-549e-a688-72a8c218ac7b" "answer-949785f1-bc84-54a6-aa50-79802f8ac400" "answer-0b4fbc1c-3545-5745-89f4-848a4e77fc0b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-70b508c8-5bef-5ba4-be2d-d5c002a6fd14" :answer/id #uuid "70b508c8-5bef-5ba4-be2d-d5c002a6fd14" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b96b832a-78b1-56de-b64f-6e8bbc3e0065" :answer/id #uuid "b96b832a-78b1-56de-b64f-6e8bbc3e0065" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6779cc08-804c-549e-a688-72a8c218ac7b" :answer/id #uuid "6779cc08-804c-549e-a688-72a8c218ac7b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-949785f1-bc84-54a6-aa50-79802f8ac400" :answer/id #uuid "949785f1-bc84-54a6-aa50-79802f8ac400" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0b4fbc1c-3545-5745-89f4-848a4e77fc0b" :answer/id #uuid "0b4fbc1c-3545-5745-89f4-848a4e77fc0b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-67ca50b0-637c-5544-b80a-0086acfa0a59" :question/id #uuid "67ca50b0-637c-5544-b80a-0086acfa0a59" :question/math-academy-id "q-114468" :question/problem "Calculate ${\\int }_{1}^{2}(2{sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{3}-1)-3+2{cos}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{3}-1))\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "From the identity ${sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta =1,$ with $\\theta =\\frac{x}{3}-1,$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{3}-1)+{cos}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{3}-1)=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}(2{sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{3}-1)-3+2{cos}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{3}-1))\\text{d}x & = \\\\ {\\int }_{1}^{2}(2[{sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{3}-1)+{cos}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{3}-1)]-3)\\text{d}x & = \\\\ {\\int }_{1}^{2}(2(1)-3)\\text{d}x & = \\\\ -{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\text{d}x & = \\\\ -x\\,{|}_{1}^{2} & = \\\\ -(2-1) & = \\\\ -1 & .\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-05543962-4127-57e7-802c-654a5d1cc094"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-05543962-4127-57e7-802c-654a5d1cc094" :answer-field/id #uuid "05543962-4127-57e7-802c-654a5d1cc094" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-6d22de40-ea9d-5b02-b173-001334c7aa47" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6d22de40-ea9d-5b02-b173-001334c7aa47" "answer-a9eea812-8b18-5d6c-8b4a-96c0c0fdf7a7" "answer-a179ef6b-2edf-5a1b-a42e-681c262094e9" "answer-c036b8c0-7240-5495-8524-f123ce10d9ea" "answer-e4e1cdb2-01c4-599a-b0e1-dac97bfc07ef"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6d22de40-ea9d-5b02-b173-001334c7aa47" :answer/id #uuid "6d22de40-ea9d-5b02-b173-001334c7aa47" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a9eea812-8b18-5d6c-8b4a-96c0c0fdf7a7" :answer/id #uuid "a9eea812-8b18-5d6c-8b4a-96c0c0fdf7a7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a179ef6b-2edf-5a1b-a42e-681c262094e9" :answer/id #uuid "a179ef6b-2edf-5a1b-a42e-681c262094e9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2-\\operatorname{cos}⁡1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c036b8c0-7240-5495-8524-f123ce10d9ea" :answer/id #uuid "c036b8c0-7240-5495-8524-f123ce10d9ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2(\\operatorname{sin}⁡2-\\operatorname{sin}⁡2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e4e1cdb2-01c4-599a-b0e1-dac97bfc07ef" :answer/id #uuid "e4e1cdb2-01c4-599a-b0e1-dac97bfc07ef" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{csc}⁡1-\\operatorname{csc}⁡2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-5e890818-44b2-5fa4-a0b6-4c9a2cfbfd6f" :question/id #uuid "5e890818-44b2-5fa4-a0b6-4c9a2cfbfd6f" :question/math-academy-id "q-73529" :question/problem "${\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}(1-{cot}^{2}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{4}))\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "From the identity $1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta $ with $\\theta =x-\\frac{\\pi }{4},$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1+{cot}^{2}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{4}) & ={csc}^{2}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\ {cot}^{2}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{4}) & ={csc}^{2}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{4})-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}(1-{cot}^{2}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{4}))\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}(1-{csc}^{2}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{4})+1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}(2-{csc}^{2}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{4}))\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}2\\,\\text{d}x-{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}{csc}^{2}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{4})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2x{|}_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}+\\operatorname{cot}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{4}){|}_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4} \\\\  & =2(\\frac{3\\pi }{4}-\\frac{\\pi }{2})+\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4}-\\frac{\\pi }{4})-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2}-\\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =2(\\frac{\\pi }{4})+\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{2}+0-1 \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{2}-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-18c90a23-59a9-5282-89e5-a5dfddf8ce79"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-18c90a23-59a9-5282-89e5-a5dfddf8ce79" :answer-field/id #uuid "18c90a23-59a9-5282-89e5-a5dfddf8ce79" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-f7449390-3d4e-54f0-a121-f8acf6006130" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e73f1488-a01d-5db0-b321-5aa7c70413f0" "answer-f7449390-3d4e-54f0-a121-f8acf6006130" "answer-97915e10-8926-58fa-8c08-872ae939879a" "answer-8b659d5b-ffc1-56c2-ab05-c2b4ce6bb943" "answer-a52f2e45-3e7d-50ca-b3ac-e9182e500551"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e73f1488-a01d-5db0-b321-5aa7c70413f0" :answer/id #uuid "e73f1488-a01d-5db0-b321-5aa7c70413f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f7449390-3d4e-54f0-a121-f8acf6006130" :answer/id #uuid "f7449390-3d4e-54f0-a121-f8acf6006130" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{2}-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-97915e10-8926-58fa-8c08-872ae939879a" :answer/id #uuid "97915e10-8926-58fa-8c08-872ae939879a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8b659d5b-ffc1-56c2-ab05-c2b4ce6bb943" :answer/id #uuid "8b659d5b-ffc1-56c2-ab05-c2b4ce6bb943" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{4}+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a52f2e45-3e7d-50ca-b3ac-e9182e500551" :answer/id #uuid "a52f2e45-3e7d-50ca-b3ac-e9182e500551" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{4}-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186096846 :activity/expected-seconds 1500.0 :db/ensure [:activit